provenance, licenses, pinned revisions, and file hashes are recorded in
THIRD-PARTY-MODELS.md; the summary:

  - BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 (embedder) -- MIT. Commercial use and
    redistribution permitted.

  - Xenova/nli-deberta-v3-base (NLI judge) -- license UNRESOLVED. The
    upstream cross-encoder checkpoint is Apache-2.0, but the exact ONNX
    mirror this image bakes declares no license of its own. Read
    THIRD-PARTY-MODELS.md before assuming it is clear to redistribute a
    built image containing this checkpoint.
